{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19166","headline":"赴苏州酬别乐天 · 刘禹锡","name":"赴苏州酬别乐天","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴郡鱼书下紫宸，长安厩吏送朱轮。\n二南风化承遗爱，八咏声名蹑後尘。\n梁氏夫妻爲寄客，陆家兄弟是州民。\n江城春日追游处，共忆东归旧主人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19166.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19166","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}